1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
This is an important announcement
about changes to local bus services.

2
00:00:05,039 --> 00:00:08,670
Route 42, which runs
between the Town Centre and

3
00:00:08,694 --> 00:00:12,412
Westfield, is changing.
Route 44 is not affected.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,960
The changes begin on Monday, not
this weekend as we announced previously.

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:20,800
Three new stops are being added
to serve the new housing estates.

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:23,653
One stop will no longer
be served: Elm Street.

7
00:00:23,677 --> 00:00:26,492
Passengers who use it
should go to the stop on

8
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:29,815
Oak Avenue instead.
The first departure of

9
00:00:29,839 --> 00:00:33,372
the day will be earlier:
6am instead of 6.30.

10
00:00:33,459 --> 00:00:38,000
In the rush hour, buses will run
every 10 minutes rather than every 15.

11
00:00:38,099 --> 00:00:43,360
The old diesel buses are being replaced and
every journey will now use an electric bus.

12
00:00:43,509 --> 00:00:46,000
Full timetables and
maps are on the website.

13
00:00:46,024 --> 00:00:48,812
This time no printed
leaflets are being produced.

14
00:00:48,899 --> 00:00:52,228
During the changeover
period all fares will be half price.

15
00:00:52,252 --> 00:00:54,567
Passengers at the
park road stop will be

16
00:00:54,568 --> 00:00:57,332
pleased to hear that a new
shelter has been put up there.

17
00:00:57,356 --> 00:01:00,010
These arrangements will
stay in place for six months.

18
00:01:00,011 --> 00:01:04,572
If you have questions, please call
the helpline rather than the bus station.

19
00:01:04,659 --> 00:01:07,092
From Monday to Saturday,
buses will run at the

20
00:01:07,116 --> 00:01:10,637
normal frequency, but there will
be a reduced service on Sundays.

21
00:01:10,638 --> 00:01:13,575
All buses now offer
free Wi-Fi and charging

22
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:17,572
points are planned. Buses will
no longer finish at Westfield.

23
00:01:17,573 --> 00:01:19,552
Instead, the route
will carry on to

24
00:01:19,576 --> 00:01:22,647
the hospital where it will
terminate. Screens showing

25
00:01:22,648 --> 00:01:26,089
real-time arrival information
are being installed at the stops.

26
00:01:26,113 --> 00:01:28,167
School bus users
will not be affected

27
00:01:28,168 --> 00:01:31,090
by any of these changes.
The reason for the changes

28
00:01:31,114 --> 00:01:34,167
is the roadworks on the
high street. We expect normal

29
00:01:34,168 --> 00:01:37,036
service to resume next
year. Finally, refunds for

30
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:39,767
tickets affected by the
changes can be claimed

31
00:01:39,768 --> 00:01:42,362
at the ticket office.
Thank you for listening

32
00:01:42,386 --> 00:01:44,652
and we apologise
for any inconvenience.

